<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[带信物查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Antler 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Weather.precipitation is "rain">>夜雾缭绕的古德鲁伊石环月泉祭坛前，<<else>>林间清光洒落的古德鲁伊石环主柱下，<</if>>你举起白鹿角坠饰，让坠饰尖端的螺旋纹对准月泉出水口的石雕鹿首。鹿角坠饰侧面钻有一枚细小的破雾音孔，吹气即可发出清越鹿鸣。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3 is 1>>
白鹿角坠饰今日已引动过月泉石雕暗流，泉水清冽甘甜。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "将白鹿角坠饰嵌入石鹿额心 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3")>><<money 420>>清泉改道冲开石池暗龛，浮出一只装满古德鲁伊奉纳银币的柏木盒。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">白鹿角坠饰开启了月泉祭坛的水下暗龛。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收妥白鹿角坠返回石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	泉水冰冷激手，坠饰在湿石上滑脱半寸。<span class="red">你擦干石鹿额心水渍准备再嵌。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住指尖重新尝试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回月泉祭坛石阶下 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顺着鹿角坠音孔吹出清音 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-3">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 430 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3_alt")>><<money 480>>悠远鹿鸣在石柱群间回荡，树根石台缓缓裂开一道缝隙，露出古币与灵草。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">鹿鸣清音唤醒了石环古老的馈赠。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[整理信物离开 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	林间山风吹散了尾音，石台只轻轻颤了一下。<span class="red">你等阵风过去准备再吹一次。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[按住音孔调整气息再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回主区域 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[带信物查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Mask 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>华灯璀璨的峭壁天鹅绒暗层拍卖厅后廊，<<else>>幽静奢华的天鹅绒暗层贵宾画廊里，<</if>>你将纯银狐面胸针别在领口，走近那扇只对核心假面会员敞开的紫檀暗门。胸针背面设有双层暗针，暗门锁孔上方正映着一束微弱的折光斑。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3 is 1>>
纯银狐面胸针今日已为你开启过紫檀密室，暗香在衣领间萦绕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "将狐面胸针对准光斑 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-3">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3")>><<money 420>>胸针银面将壁灯光束折射入暗锁，紫檀门无声滑开，桌上放着一匣贵宾红利筹码。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">纯银狐面胸针为你打开了核心贵宾室。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[别好狐面胸针返回回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	壁灯光线角度略偏，光斑差了半寸才照进锁孔。<span class="red">你微调胸针倾角准备重新对光。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住指尖重新尝试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回贵宾画廊绒帘外 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拨开胸针双层暗针插细孔 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3_alt")>><<money 480>>双层暗针精准顶开内簧，密室小格弹出，你将里面的不记名金券收入怀中。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你巧用胸针背面的暗针开启了密室金格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[整理信物离开 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗针纤细富有弹性，插入时指尖微微一抖。<span class="red">你扶住门框稳住手指准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[对准折光斑角度再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回主区域 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[带信物查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Lens 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>星光透过旧学园天文翼楼的折光穹顶，<<else>>天光映照的旧学园天文翼楼星图室里，<</if>>你将消色差古透镜装入主赤道仪的副寻星镜筒，对准钟塔尖顶的刻度盘。寻星镜筒下方的星图匣封着一枚感光火漆，借透镜聚光即可将其烘软。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3 is 1>>
消色差古透镜今日已校准过钟塔尖顶暗记，镜片澄澈透亮。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "旋动古透镜调焦对准 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
