	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收起古透镜返回天文翼楼 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	高处云影掠过遮住了光线，视场一时模糊。<span class="red">你等云影散开准备重新调焦。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住指尖重新尝试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回赤道仪观测台边 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "借古透镜聚光烘化星图火漆 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-3">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3_alt")>><<money 480>>聚焦光斑温热融开感光火漆，抽屉无声滑开，露出一叠早期学园基金银券。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">聚焦光斑巧妙解开了星图桌的火漆暗屉。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[整理信物离开 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	焦点距离差了一分，火漆只微微变软。<span class="red">你调整透镜高度准备重新聚光。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住透镜聚光焦点再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回主区域 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
